{
  "_meta": {
    "title": "Swiftpass API — worked examples",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "baseUrl": "https://api.swiftpass.np/v1",
    "notes": [
      "Every amount is an integer in paisa. 850000 = NPR 8,500.00",
      "Every mutating POST requires an Idempotency-Key header (UUIDv4).",
      "Auth: Authorization: Bearer <access_token>. Scanner apps use a device-scoped token.",
      "The scenario below is one continuous journey: KTM->PKR flight, PKR->Beni bus, and a concert in Pokhara — booked in ONE checkout."
    ]
  },

